	(text "FC input: regulated 5V from external BEC / power module. Battery monitoring is external; target 60A.\nUSB bench: stable Type-C source advertising >=1.5A. MCU logic 3.3V; servo PWM signals 5V nominal.\nBattery monitor / BEC is a separate KiCad project. Calibrate to the selected external monitor."
